  "answers": [
    "Where is DATA_WAREHOUSE_SOURCES defined",
    "ImportError DATA_WAREHOUSE_SOURCES from posthog.cdp.validation"
  ],
  "body": "`DATA_WAREHOUSE_SOURCES` is defined in posthog/cdp/filters.py because the compiler needs it; validation.py only re-imports it. New code (e.g. products/cdp/backend/api/hog_function.py, products/workflows/backend/api/hog_flow.py) imports it from `posthog.cdp.filters`, not `posthog.cdp.validation`, to avoid a circular dependency (validation imports filters).",
